(6245996, 923559, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the abstractness that the blur presents.  It''s almost as if the two white "things" are sheep running. :) I like it.</td>', 'I love the abstractness that the blur presents.  It''s almost as if the two white "things" are sheep running. :) I like it.', '2010-12-06 09:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6245997, 923945, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition.  The diagonal line of the vapor trail piercing through the bare branches is just stunning.  That hint of reflection in the lower right is a tad distracting, but the rest of the image makes up for it.  Love it.</td>', 'Perfect composition.  The diagonal line of the vapor trail piercing through the bare branches is just stunning.  That hint of reflection in the lower right is a tad distracting, but the rest of the image makes up for it.  Love it.', '2010-12-06 09:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6245999, 923746, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool how the upper piece of wood floating in the water mimics the shape of the dog.  The invisible diagonal line connecting them is way cool.</td>', 'Cool how the upper piece of wood floating in the water mimics the shape of the dog.  The invisible diagonal line connecting them is way cool.', '2010-12-06 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246002, 923604, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just stunning.  The silhouetted trees and the undulating  hill.  Holy sh*t!!  This would be so amazing on a HUGE canvas.</td>', 'This is just stunning.  The silhouetted trees and the undulating  hill.  Holy sh*t!!  This would be so amazing on a HUGE canvas.', '2010-12-06 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246003, 923706, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh, now I''ll be thinking of Jefferson Starship''s "White Bird" all day. :)</td>', 'Oh, now I''ll be thinking of Jefferson Starship''s "White Bird" all day. :)', '2010-12-06 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246004, 923752, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the low key approach.  That helicopter.  Or is it a bird?  LOL</td>', 'I love the low key approach.  That helicopter.  Or is it a bird?  LOL', '2010-12-06 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246009, 923566, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is totally cool.  That fisheye really served you well.  Outstanding and totally unexpected.</td>', 'That is totally cool.  That fisheye really served you well.  Outstanding and totally unexpected.', '2010-12-06 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
