(6246023, 923559, 120666, '<td valign="top">Seems to me that using the definition of Horizon line as your title, coupled with a very artistic image, that has little visible horizon in it, is a poor combination. I really like the warm earth tones and the look of the image, just not for this challenge. Though I did stare at your image a loong time. 5</td>', 'Seems to me that using the definition of Horizon line as your title, coupled with a very artistic image, that has little visible horizon in it, is a poor combination. I really like the warm earth tones and the look of the image, just not for this challenge. Though I did stare at your image a loong time. 5', '2010-12-06 10:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246024, 923322, 120666, '<td valign="top">where?</td>', 'where?', '2010-12-06 10:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
