(6246032, 923250, 120666, '<td valign="top">I so want to give this a better score, but what is it? The title doesn''t help me, Almost looks like its shot through a window with a reflection of the curtain at night with a crazy high ISO. The possible sensor blobs hurt too. Sorry.</td>', 'I so want to give this a better score, but what is it? The title doesn''t help me, Almost looks like its shot through a window with a reflection of the curtain at night with a crazy high ISO. The possible sensor blobs hurt too. Sorry.', '2010-12-06 10:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
