(6246135, 923504, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of scale here, and the motion blur, but my first reaction was to the title, which to me does not match the image.  The person does not appear lost at all, as his stride appears purposeful rather than hesitant.</td>', 'Love the sense of scale here, and the motion blur, but my first reaction was to the title, which to me does not match the image.  The person does not appear lost at all, as his stride appears purposeful rather than hesitant.', '2010-12-06 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
