(6246166, 923719, 96751, '<td valign="top">I know why you chose such a narrow height - it is a marvelous panorama.  Incredible delicacy in the shapes and in the tones.  I also love the two lines of trees, one getting bolder in the foreground, the other disappearing into the distance.  But I think the tiny size of the image works against you.  A narrower crop, taking out everything left of the second tree and everything right of the tractor, would have made the same statement and given you a larger image.</td>', 'I know why you chose such a narrow height - it is a marvelous panorama.  Incredible delicacy in the shapes and in the tones.  I also love the two lines of trees, one getting bolder in the foreground, the other disappearing into the distance.  But I think the tiny size of the image works against you.  A narrower crop, taking out everything left of the second tree and everything right of the tractor, would have made the same statement and given you a larger image.', '2010-12-06 12:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6246169, 923746, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  Sensational.</td>', 'Oh wow.  Sensational.', '2010-12-06 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
