(6246171, 923867, 96751, '<td valign="top">This feels like twilight, or late afternoon on overcast, wintery day.  Didn''t notice the dog and walkers until after lingering to look for a while.</td>', 'This feels like twilight, or late afternoon on overcast, wintery day.  Didn''t notice the dog and walkers until after lingering to look for a while.', '2010-12-06 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
