(6250347, 923895, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of scale.</td>', 'Love the sense of scale.', '2010-12-10 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250348, 923894, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like the evening view I get some nights here.  I''m rather fond of that view.  Definitely meets the challege, too.</td>', 'Looks very much like the evening view I get some nights here.  I''m rather fond of that view.  Definitely meets the challege, too.', '2010-12-10 01:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250349, 923398, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for the very nice use of the foreground lamp.  And even I can appreciate lovley oversaturated DPC colors when they suit the photograph.  :-)</td>', 'One of my favorites for the very nice use of the foreground lamp.  And even I can appreciate lovley oversaturated DPC colors when they suit the photograph.  :-)', '2010-12-10 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250350, 923566, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a novel approach!  Well done.</td>', 'What a novel approach!  Well done.', '2010-12-10 01:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250351, 923322, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly embodies the challenge extremely well.  This is all about the horizon.  And that cool foreground, but mostly the horizon.</td>', 'Truly embodies the challenge extremely well.  This is all about the horizon.  And that cool foreground, but mostly the horizon.', '2010-12-10 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250352, 923855, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent sense of scale, wonderful undulations in the sky.</td>', 'Excellent sense of scale, wonderful undulations in the sky.', '2010-12-10 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250353, 923622, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the three birds dipping down, the three clouds rising up.  And one of your signature jetties.  No comma this time, though.  Slash is a nice touch.  :-)</td>', 'I like the contrast between the three birds dipping down, the three clouds rising up.  And one of your signature jetties.  No comma this time, though.  Slash is a nice touch.  :-)', '2010-12-10 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250356, 923709, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent title; soothing and indeed quiet world presented here.  Nice place to stop and visit for a while.</td>', 'Excellent title; soothing and indeed quiet world presented here.  Nice place to stop and visit for a while.', '2010-12-10 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250357, 923886, 30982, '<td valign="top">Amazingly well done HDR or HDR-like processing.  Almost surreal in its clarity.  The gentle light in the sky is simply gorgeous.</td>', 'Amazingly well done HDR or HDR-like processing.  Almost surreal in its clarity.  The gentle light in the sky is simply gorgeous.', '2010-12-10 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250358, 923193, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lost ribbons blown far from home.  Great sense of motion, almost of a desperate escape in a way.</td>', 'Lost ribbons blown far from home.  Great sense of motion, almost of a desperate escape in a way.', '2010-12-10 01:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250359, 923634, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the wide wide presentation - suits this very well.  Heartland in winter.  Quite nice!</td>', 'Love the wide wide presentation - suits this very well.  Heartland in winter.  Quite nice!', '2010-12-10 01:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250360, 923688, 30982, '<td valign="top">A novel and colorful interpretation.  Wonderful use of the low angle!</td>', 'A novel and colorful interpretation.  Wonderful use of the low angle!', '2010-12-10 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250362, 923857, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love that sun peeking through!</td>', 'Love that sun peeking through!', '2010-12-10 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250363, 923807, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice!  Works very well for me in the slightly toned monochrome, too.</td>', 'Wonderful choice!  Works very well for me in the slightly toned monochrome, too.', '2010-12-10 01:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250364, 923918, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to find a few shots here and there where "horizon" was an implication - this is an excellent example of that!</td>', 'I was hoping to find a few shots here and there where "horizon" was an implication - this is an excellent example of that!', '2010-12-10 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250365, 923945, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite striking!</td>', 'Quite striking!', '2010-12-10 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250366, 923504, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile - there''s a wonderful warmth that perhaps only I get from this.  A sense of solitude but not loneliness.  Just a zen-one-with-nature kinda thing.</td>', 'Makes me smile - there''s a wonderful warmth that perhaps only I get from this.  A sense of solitude but not loneliness.  Just a zen-one-with-nature kinda thing.', '2010-12-10 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250369, 923649, 30982, '<td valign="top">The hair of the dog!  VERY cool interpretation!</td>', 'The hair of the dog!  VERY cool interpretation!', '2010-12-10 01:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250370, 923702, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very striking - and VERY cold!  I like the horizon of steam, smoke and clouds in addition to that of the rooftops.</td>', 'Very striking - and VERY cold!  I like the horizon of steam, smoke and clouds in addition to that of the rooftops.', '2010-12-10 01:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250374, 923706, 52902, '<td valign="top">Too blurry</td>', 'Too blurry', '2010-12-10 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250378, 923701, 52902, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2010-12-10 01:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250379, 923406, 52902, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea!</td>', 'Very nice idea!', '2010-12-10 01:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250391, 923250, 18655, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image with earthy colors. The trees (?) on the left offsets it nicely. 8</td>', 'Wonderful image with earthy colors. The trees (?) on the left offsets it nicely. 8', '2010-12-10 02:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250392, 923483, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great lines, shapes and colors - 8</td>', 'Great lines, shapes and colors - 8', '2010-12-10 02:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250393, 923894, 18655, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful... great job - 10</td>', 'This is beautiful... great job - 10', '2010-12-10 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250395, 923719, 18655, '<td valign="top">Wonderful panorama. Love the style and subtlety. 9</td>', 'Wonderful panorama. Love the style and subtlety. 9', '2010-12-10 02:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250418, 923807, 121789, '<td valign="top">This looks like the 3 amigos versus the great a terrible world - B/W enhances this 8</td>', 'This looks like the 3 amigos versus the great a terrible world - B/W enhances this 8', '2010-12-10 05:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250419, 923666, 121789, '<td valign="top">The B/W and the branch in the foreground give this an otherworldly look - 7</td>', 'The B/W and the branch in the foreground give this an otherworldly look - 7', '2010-12-10 05:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250421, 923250, 121789, '<td valign="top">1000 words - very visceral and compelling 9</td>', '1000 words - very visceral and compelling 9', '2010-12-10 05:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250422, 923867, 121789, '<td valign="top">You don''t say . . . +1 for the title! 7</td>', 'You don''t say . . . +1 for the title! 7', '2010-12-10 05:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250423, 923421, 121789, '<td valign="top">The vignette and post processing give this a very nostalgic feel - I like it 8</td>', 'The vignette and post processing give this a very nostalgic feel - I like it 8', '2010-12-10 05:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250424, 923322, 121789, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to get lost in this image - 8</td>', 'It''s easy to get lost in this image - 8', '2010-12-10 05:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250425, 923566, 121789, '<td valign="top">nice presentation and colors - I like the curved perspective! 8</td>', 'nice presentation and colors - I like the curved perspective! 8', '2010-12-10 05:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250427, 923758, 121789, '<td valign="top">The title introduces a subtle tension through expectation. I like it - 8</td>', 'The title introduces a subtle tension through expectation. I like it - 8', '2010-12-10 05:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250428, 923643, 113156, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water the rocks and the vegetation all blend in to the horizon, really nice photo.</td>', 'I like the way the water the rocks and the vegetation all blend in to the horizon, really nice photo.', '2010-12-10 05:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
