(6250872, 923592, 54838, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and depth with a strong focus on a foreground and background and just a hint of the vast distance between.  Horizon feels strong in this photo - i like it.</td>', 'Gorgeous color and depth with a strong focus on a foreground and background and just a hint of the vast distance between.  Horizon feels strong in this photo - i like it.', '2010-12-10 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
