(6250877, 923716, 54838, '<td valign="top">post processing feels overdone and horizon seems to be a secondary focus.  I feel like it might be trying to convey a distance or "almost there" feeling with the destination off in the horizon but the rusty poles are too distracting for me.</td>', 'post processing feels overdone and horizon seems to be a secondary focus.  I feel like it might be trying to convey a distance or "almost there" feeling with the destination off in the horizon but the rusty poles are too distracting for me.', '2010-12-10 20:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250879, 923624, 54838, '<td valign="top">Nice color, obvious horizon, nice photo.</td>', 'Nice color, obvious horizon, nice photo.', '2010-12-10 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250892, 923654, 121789, '<td valign="top">I like the processing - it adds a vague uncertainty while the title ties it all up with an accidental reassignment of priority. Not only do I start imagining the rest of the scene, but I wonder what the fate is of the perspective holder who sees this image. The more I look at this one, the more I see and the more I see, the longer I look. Now I realize I am the perspective holder and I wonder some more. Very well done - 10 and a favorite. Thank you for this image.</td>', 'I like the processing - it adds a vague uncertainty while the title ties it all up with an accidental reassignment of priority. Not only do I start imagining the rest of the scene, but I wonder what the fate is of the perspective holder who sees this image. The more I look at this one, the more I see and the more I see, the longer I look. Now I realize I am the perspective holder and I wonder some more. Very well done - 10 and a favorite. Thank you for this image.', '2010-12-10 20:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6250903, 923426, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Not much more to say. Excellent find, great exposure. Nice one.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Not much more to say. Excellent find, great exposure. Nice one.', '2010-12-10 21:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
