(6252756, 923250, 62357, '<td valign="top">Oh this was right up there for me, I love it. The textures are wonderful.  I guess I''m in texture heaven at the moment with all the side challenge textures I''ve been playing with.  Oh and I meant to say thanks for adding me as a fave the other day.  I appreciate it.<br/> <br/>I gave you a 9 by the way! I think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bvy</a>''s comment entirely reflects my own.</td>', 'Oh this was right up there for me, I love it. The textures are wonderful.  I guess I''m in texture heaven at the moment with all the side challenge textures I''ve been playing with.  Oh and I meant to say thanks for adding me as a fave the other day.  I appreciate it. I gave you a 9 by the way! I think  Bvy''s comment entirely reflects my own.', '2010-12-13 12:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
