(6253057, 923250, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg"/></a> You got an XPrize, for my highest rated images that came in the lowest in the final standings.<br/> <br/>A fascinating, dark and heavy image.  The high line, the hints of structures, or trees, all work to create an oppressive and vaguely threatening image.  Nicely done indeed.</td>', ' You got an XPrize, for my highest rated images that came in the lowest in the final standings. A fascinating, dark and heavy image.  The high line, the hints of structures, or trees, all work to create an oppressive and vaguely threatening image.  Nicely done indeed.', '2010-12-13 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
